control: A state the operator fixes, no account, an account that cannot connect or a policy that does not validate, fails neither probe
removes: a policy whose rows do not validate holds the Session not ready
packages: ./process/sessions
tests: TestAPolicyThatDoesNotValidateHoldsUpNoProbe
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

